  "description": "⭐ <strong><em>Candlelight</em></strong><em> concerts bring the magic of a live, multi-sensory musical experience to awe-inspiring locations like never seen before in London. Get your tickets now to discover the music of Bollywood and Tollywood on Strings at Southwark Cathedral under the gentle glow of candlelight.</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<em>This is a tribute concert experience. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the artist, their estate, or official representatives.</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📍 Venue: Southwark Cathedral<br>\r\n📅 Dates and times: select your dates/times directly in the ticket selector<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: 60 minutes. Doors open 45 minutes before the show and <strong>close 5 minutes prior to the start. Late arrivals will not be permitted</strong><br>\r\n👤 Age requirement: 8 years old or older. Anyone under the age of 16 must be accompanied by an adult<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: this venue is wheelchair accessible<br>\r\n❓ View the FAQs for this event <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTH1a2g4iLj2_LMXyzfWtnSH6SNpOMa6D5Dpwp3-ngbjah-oJUCHtkwBU0H36GS9wjUW4esWYZ3wJMt/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n🪑 Seating is assigned on a first come first served basis in each zone<br>\r\n🚇 Get there with the TfL Network<br>\r\n🕯️ If you would like to book a private concert or buy regular tickets for a large group (+30 people), click <a href=\"https://candlelightexperience.com/groups/#groups-form\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n🎻 Check out all the <a href=\"https://feverup.com/en/london/candlelight-london\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candlelight concerts</a> in London<br>\r\n🎁 To treat your friends and family to a Candlelight gift card, click <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/95252\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><strong>Programme</strong>Tum Hi Ho from Aashiqui 2 - Mithoon (2013)</li>\r\n\t<li>Pehla Nasha from Jo Jeeta Wohi Sikandar - Jatin-Lalit (1992)</li>\r\n\t<li>Kal Ho Naa Ho from Kal Ho Naa Ho - Shankar-Ehsaan-Loy (2003)</li>\r\n\t<li>Zara Zara from Rehnaa Hai Terre Dil Mein - Harris Jayaraj (2001)</li>\r\n\t<li>Tujhe Bhula Diya from Anjaana Anjaani - Vishal-Shekhar (2010)</li>\r\n\t<li>Iktara from Wake Up Sid - Amit Trivedi (2009)</li>\r\n\t<li>Tujh Mein Rab Dikta Hai from Rab Ne Bana Di Jodi - Salim-Sulaiman (2008)</li>\r\n\t<li>Lag Ja Gale from Woh Kaun Thi - Madan Mohan (1964)</li>\r\n\t<li>Chura Liya Hai Tumne Jo Dil Ko from Yaadon Ki Baaraat - R.D. Burman (1973)</li>\r\n\t<li>Samajavaragamana from Ala Vaikunthapurramuloo - Thaman S (2019)</li>\r\n\t<li>Why This Kolaveri Di? from 3 - Anirudh Ravichander (2011)</li>\r\n\t<li>Oo Antava from Pushpa - The Rise - Devi Sri Prasad (2021)</li>\r\n\t<li>Jai Ho from Slumdog Millionaire - A.R. Rahman (2008)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><strong>Performers</strong></li>\r\n\t<li>Morassi Quartet</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Seating Map</strong>\r\n\r\n<center><img src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/c27babee-f553-11f0-a5fb-7e4ac0542079.png\" width=\"290px\"></center>",
